{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "上周以来修改过资料，上面的对比按现在的目标计算。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You've updated your profile since last week, so this comparison uses your current target."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上周以来修改过资料，上面的对比按现在的目标计算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上周小结" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Last Week"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上周小结"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上周有 %lld 天的记录比较完整，还算不出有参考价值的平均。这完全没关系，记录多少都有用；这周想记的时候记就好。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "variations" : {
            "plural" : {
              "one" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Last week had %lld fairly complete day of logs, not enough for a meaningful average. That's completely fine; every entry helps. Log this week whenever you like."
                }
              },
              "other" : {
                "stringUnit" : {
                  "state" : "translated",
                  "value" : "Last week had %lld fairly complete days of logs, not enough for a meaningful average. That's completely fine; every entry helps. Log this week whenever you like."
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上周有 %lld 天的记录比较完整，还算不出有参考价值的平均。这完全没关系，记录多少都有用；这周想记的时候记就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "不显示任何热量提示。每日目标和记录功能不受影响。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No calorie hints are shown. Your daily targets and logging work as usual."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不显示任何热量提示。每日目标和记录功能不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "为了让%@仍然是一顿像样的正餐，这里按约 %@ 千卡来推荐；稍微多一点没关系，看一周的整体就好。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "To keep %1$@ a proper meal, this suggestion is based on about %2$@ kcal. A little more is fine; the week as a whole is what matters."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为了让%@仍然是一顿像样的正餐，这里按约 %@ 千卡来推荐；稍微多一点没关系，看一周的整体就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天剩下约 %@ 千卡。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "About %@ kcal left for today. "
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天剩下约 %@ 千卡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天比目标多了约 %@ 千卡。一天的数字有起伏很正常，看的是几周的平均；明天照常吃、照常记录就好。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You're about %@ kcal above today's target. Daily numbers naturally go up and down; what counts is the average over a few weeks. Eat and log as usual tomorrow."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天比目标多了约 %@ 千卡。一天的数字有起伏很正常，看的是几周的平均；明天照常吃、照常记录就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天比目标多了约 %@ 千卡。偶尔一天这样很正常，对整体趋势没什么影响；%@照常吃、照常记录就好。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You're about %1$@ kcal above today's target. A day like this now and then is normal and barely affects your overall trend. Have %2$@ and log it as usual."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天比目标多了约 %@ 千卡。偶尔一天这样很正常，对整体趋势没什么影响；%@照常吃、照常记录就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "今天的摄入差不多就在目标线上。%@照常吃、照常记录就好，稍微多一点也没关系。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "You're right around today's target. Have %@ and log it as usual; a little extra is fine."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "今天的摄入差不多就在目标线上。%@照常吃、照常记录就好，稍微多一点也没关系。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
