    "今天离目标还有约 %@ 千卡，可以留给%@。%@照常吃就好，稍微多一点也没关系。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "About %1$@ kcal to go today, which you can save for %2$@. Have %3$@ as usual; a little extra is fine."
