    },
    "如果觉得现在的目标有点紧，可以把它调到更容易坚持的水平。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If your current target feels a bit tight, you can adjust it to a level that's easier to keep up."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果觉得现在的目标有点紧，可以把它调到更容易坚持的水平。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "完成" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Done"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "完成"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "平均每天比目标低约 %@ 千卡。吃够也很重要：目标本身就是为你算好的量，不用再往下压；如果只是有几餐没记录，那也很常见。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On average you were about %@ kcal a day below your target. Eating enough matters too: the target is already set for you, so there's no need to go lower. If a few meals just weren't logged, that's common too."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "平均每天比目标低约 %@ 千卡。吃够也很重要：目标本身就是为你算好的量，不用再往下压；如果只是有几餐没记录，那也很常见。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "平均每天比目标高约 %@ 千卡。一周有起伏很正常，看整体趋势比盯着某一天更有用；这周照常吃、照常记录就好。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "On average you were about %@ kcal a day above your target. Ups and downs within a week are normal, and the overall trend tells you more than any single day. Eat and log as usual this week."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "平均每天比目标高约 %@ 千卡。一周有起伏很正常，看整体趋势比盯着某一天更有用；这周照常吃、照常记录就好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "平均每天约 %@ 千卡（目标 %@）· 按记录较完整的 %lld 天计算" : {
